Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.20,Hook,,0,0,0,,Remote… but not for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,You find a {\c&H00EB6325&}remote{\c&H00FFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.66,0:00:02.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,job that actually fits,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.38,0:00:03.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,right role,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.44,0:00:04.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,decent pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.94,0:00:06.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,You get halfway through
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.28,0:00:07.03,Cap,,0,0,0,,the application,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.78,0:00:08.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,and there it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.68,0:00:09.59,Cap,,0,0,0,,right at the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.46,0:00:11.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,Must be based in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.42,0:00:12.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,our country that {\c&H00EB6325&}isn't{\c&H00FFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.50,0:00:12.89,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00EB6325&}yours.{\c&H00FFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.68,0:00:14.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00EB6325&}Remote{\c&H00FFFFFF&} tells you where
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.58,0:00:15.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,you'll {\c&H00EB6325&}work.{\c&H00FFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.70,0:00:16.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,It doesn't tell you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.36,0:00:17.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,where you can {\c&H00EB6325&}live,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.42,0:00:18.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,so check that line
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.12,0:00:18.65,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00EB6325&}first,{\c&H00FFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.16,0:00:20.11,Cap,,0,0,0,,before the cover letter,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.46,0:00:21.11,Cap,,0,0,0,,before anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.10,0:00:23.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,On Yireh Careers,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.38,0:00:24.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,every job shows where
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.44,0:00:25.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,it hires from,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.48,0:00:26.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,or says when the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.36,0:00:27.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,employer doesn't,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.64,0:00:28.39,Cap,,0,0,0,,links in the bio.
